infinite-patch 1
# Kora Calabash Harp Synth
node 1 Notes Note Sequencer
  id notes
  pos 0 1024
  f rateBeats 0.375
  i steps 16
  i note0 55
  i note1 62
  i note2 67
  i note3 64
  i note4 60
  i note5 67
